# dist/ is intentionally tracked here (unlike a typical Vite project): the
# static pages elsewhere in this repo (index.html, Listing/packaging.html,
# Industries/index.html) link straight to Build_your_box/dist/index.html so
# the box configurator works by double-clicking the file, no dev server or
# build step required. Re-run `npm run build` after changing src/ and commit
# the result.

